        <description>RESOLUTION PLANNING

The Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (IBC), 2016, establishes a structured framework for resolution plans to revive distressed companies while balancing creditor rights. Below is a detailed breakdown of mandatory and optional components of resolution plans under the IBC, based on statutory provisions and judicial interpretations.</description>
